{title: Tinak Tin Tana Woh}
{artist: Udit Narayan Alka Yagnik}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Tinak tin tana woh dhun bajana,        Dhinak dhin [Dm]naachun [G]main
Gaa [F]ye dil [G] , jhoome za [Am]mana,        [Am]Tinak tin tana woh dhun bajana
Dhinak dhin [Dm]naachun [G]main,        Gaa [F]ye dil [G] , jhoome za [Am]mana
[Am]Bulaaye [Dm]run-jhun, run-jhun,        [Dm]Run-jhun karti [G]payal
Hawa mein [F]udta udta Aaye,        [G]mehka [Am]aanchal
[Am]Tujhe [Dm]batalaaungi main,        Mann ki saari [G]baatein
Guzaare [F]kaise kaise,        [G]Maine yeh din [Am]raatein
Mere [E]nainon ke darpan mein,        Teri [G]yaadon ke aangan mein
Meri [E]saanson mein, jeevan mein,        Sirf teri [Am]khushbu hai [G]
Sirf tera [Am]chehra hai [G],        Sirf tera [Am]charcha hai [G]
Sirf tera [Am]pehra hai,        [Am]Tinak tin tana woh dhun bajana
Dhinak dhin [Dm]naachun [G]main,        Gaa [F]ye dil [G] , jhoome za [Am]mana
